# Trader Joe — example environment file
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values for local development.
# `.env` is ignored by git; `.env.example` is tracked and must never
# contain real credentials.
#
# The Research Alpaca paper account is a dedicated research / replay /
# validation account. It MUST NOT share credentials with:
#   - the normal paper-trading account used by the live runner
#   - any crypto trading account
#   - any production trading account
#
# See docs/agent/operations.md and ROADMAP.md (Phase 5) for details.

# --- Research Alpaca paper account (validation / replay / research only) ---
RESEARCH_ALPACA_API_KEY=replace-with-research-paper-api-key
RESEARCH_ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=replace-with-research-paper-secret-key
RESEARCH_ALPACA_ENDPOINT=https://paper-api.alpaca.markets
